{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"snakes-and-ladders UI copy.limits","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"snakes-and-ladders.copy.limits","keys":["snakes-and-ladders.copy.limits"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"An yi wasa da Snakes da Ladders a wurare da dama tare da zane-zane daban-daban na tebur, wuraren gudu da dokoki na ƙarshe. Wannan shafi yana amfani da zane-zane na tebur na asali kuma yana lissafa dokokinsa masu iya canzawa; kada ka yi amfani da shi a matsayin sigar gida ko ta ofishin. Wannan wasa yana amfani da mai adawa na kwamfuta mai sauki, ba wani wasa na intanet ba. Babu bukata ga asusun kuma ba a karɓar motsa-motsa ba.","record_id":"fd2456c588d7533a44c591f650df0e557580170e812bab2c8543004db6022f48","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":1.9177056329999687,"source":"Snakes and Ladders is played in many places with different board art, jump locations and finish rules. This page uses original board artwork and lists its configurable overshoot rule; do not treat it as the only local or official version. The game uses a simple computer opponent, not a network match. No account is needed and no moves are uploaded.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"c0d8596849311b01674cf92f6efbd9c87f1f0113624c734764969d39c87043c3","status":"needs-review","translation":"An yi wasa da Snakes da Ladders a wurare da dama tare da zane-zane daban-daban na tebur, wuraren gudu da dokoki na ƙarshe. Wannan shafi yana amfani da zane-zane na tebur na asali kuma yana lissafa dokokinsa masu iya canzawa; kada ka yi amfani da shi a matsayin sigar gida ko ta ofishin. Wannan wasa yana amfani da mai adawa na kwamfuta mai sauki, ba wani wasa na intanet ba. Babu bukata ga asusun kuma ba a karɓar motsa-motsa ba.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"spain-termination-pay UI copy.fields.accuracyNote","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"spain-termination-pay.copy.fields.accuracyNote","keys":["spain-termination-pay.copy.fields.accuracyNote"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"An yi zaton dangantakar aiki ta fara ne a ko bayan ZXQPH0000QXZ Fabrairu ZXQPH0001QXZ kuma wannan biyan albashi na shekara-shekara ya kunshi sassan albashi na yau da kullum. Ba ya lissafa albashin da ba a biya ba, izinin tafiya, adadin albashi, haraji, yarjejeniyoyi na hadin gwiwa ko matsalolin musamman. Duba doka ta hukuma kafin ka dogara da sakamakon.","record_id":"fdac3b37a3ef4f848c741dbf628724501ba99f8fa4a79c95695557d9b2f58c02","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40523422271","seconds":2.719193360375016,"source":"An indicative estimate only, not a complete Spanish finiquito or legal advice. Assumes the employment relationship began on or after 12 February 2012 and that annual remuneration includes regular salary components. Does not calculate unpaid wages, leave, extra-pay accruals, taxes, collective agreements or special cases. Review the official law before relying on a result.","source_commit":"65626e5376c5d623fb48ed0c157c91316f836307","source_hash":"3d18a344525e59c36ea13daadfd08709d39c004509d3d9cb1a96ce2f55a37d99","status":"needs-review","translation":"An yi zaton dangantakar aiki ta fara ne a ko bayan 12 Fabrairu 2012 kuma wannan biyan albashi na shekara-shekara ya kunshi sassan albashi na yau da kullum. Ba ya lissafa albashin da ba a biya ba, izinin tafiya, adadin albashi, haraji, yarjejeniyoyi na hadin gwiwa ko matsalolin musamman. Duba doka ta hukuma kafin ka dogara da sakamakon.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"taylor-series-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"taylor-series-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","keys":["taylor-series-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer"],"locale":"ha","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Za'a iya yin nazari ga polinomial mai ƙarshe a can, amma jerin Taylor na ƙarshe ga logaritmi, asalin ɗari da ayyuka masu jujjuyawa suna haɗuwa ne kawai a cikin radius ɗinsa a kusa da tsakiya.","record_id":"fd582cb083d4e04b685e9590a95795c867bcfaacc374aaa108a53605464a8dff","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.636906210125062,"source":"The finite polynomial can be evaluated there, but the infinite Taylor series for logarithm, square root and reciprocal functions only converges inside its radius around the center.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"cc27e6f18c49493aa306f5370612c77fc3cdc6c3ee86adc2d363f63fb5dc8941","status":"needs-review","translation":"Za'a iya yin nazari ga polinomial mai ƙarshe a can, amma jerin Taylor na ƙarshe ga logaritmi, asalin ɗari da ayyuka masu jujjuyawa suna haɗuwa ne kawai a cikin radius ɗinsa a kusa da tsakiya.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
